      "description": "Welcome to the Macy’s app, the most iconic shopping destination. Find exactly what you need for the occasions that matter most. Shop fashion, beauty, accessories, home, gifts, and more. Explore brands like Calvin Klein, Michael Kors, Ralph Lauren, and more. Easily earn shopping rewards with every purchase, and unlock free shipping, birthday perks, and extra earning potential with Macy’s Star Rewards memberships. The Macy’s app is designed to make shopping and savings easier with flash sales and seasonal discounts on men’s and women’s clothing.  \n \nSave money on every purchase and make shopping more rewarding by unlocking everyday discounts and exclusive rewards right at your fingertips. Find women’s clothing inspiration, beauty services, wedding and gift registries, and exclusive Macy’s brands right in the palm of your hand. \n\nMacy’s is more than just a clothing store; we’re also the home of larger-than-life celebrations – from the Fourth of July Fireworks to the Thanksgiving Day Parade – that bring us all together. Download the Macy’s app today to experience the magic of Macy’s for yourself. \n\nMACY’S SHOPPING APP FEATURES: \n\nSHOP CLOTHING & ACCESSORIES \n- From women’s clothing and beauty to jewelry, seasonal must-haves, and men’s shoes and clothes–find everything in one place. \n- Shop handbags, furniture, mattresses, kids' clothing, gifts, electronics, and more. \n- Macy’s Pay- Enjoy faster, contactless checkout with your coupons and rewards applied instantly with Macy’s Pay. \n- Macy’s Wallet – keep all your offers, gift cards, and coupons in one place! \n\n\nREWARDS FOR SHOPPING & LOYALTY \n- Star Rewards- Platinum & Gold members get free shipping, no minimum when you shop at Macy’s with a Macy’s Card. \n- Our clothing store app allows you to track your Star Rewards balance, earn Star Money, and unlock bonus events and early access to sales.  \n- Earn shopping rewards points on every purchase (1,000 points = $10 Star Money). \n- Move through Silver, Gold, and Platinum for higher earning rates (1–5 points per $1).  \n- Enjoy birthday perks and exclusive shopping rewards, with extra earning potential through a Macy’s credit card or standard membership. \n\n \nSHOP NAME BRANDS FOR SHOES AND CLOTHES \n- Adidas \n- ALFANI \n- Calvin Klein \n- Club Room \n- Dior \n- Kylee Cosmetics \n- Levi’s  \n- Nars \n- New Balance \n- Nike \n- Reebok \n- Shox \n- Style&Co \n- Tarte Cosmetics \n- Uggs \n- and more! \n\nFind the brands you love, and unlock app-only discounts, coupons, and shopping rewards. Download the Macy’s app today to start shopping for handbags, home essentials, or shoes and clothes.",
